There are a few ways of adjusting balance:

1. weight, would make it less useful for 2-handed/1-handed+shield 
emergency use but make less difference for non-emergency use
2. blessed use has same effect as uncursed use (can still uncurse one 
arbitrary object by wielding it)
3. adjust max charges, charges on generation, charges gained from 
charging, recharge once (evil, probably unnecessary)
4. relative probability (post quest Sam could wish for one)
5. Uncursed use only removes curse from wielded item

I suggest mucking around with the charges would be the best way to 
balance. I'm undecided about point 2. Most tools are not affected by 
blessings, so maybe this should be the same.


